{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"Florian eyes the Macarons with a weakness in his eyes","created_at":"2020-08-18T05:26:33.455000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745151632580411402","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"Cato eats half the steak then feeds half to Hydraxon. The little guy loves it. Cato gives a thumbs up to Baeshra. \"Great as always.\"\nHe isn't sure what to make of the ratatouille, but he does enjoy it. As he eats a macron he feels rejuvenated. \"Well done team one. 9/10\"\n\nHe moves to team two. \"Hmm hot chocolate. Simple, but it is as cute as you three are. I like the fish\" he gives them a smile as he drinks. \"A solid performance. 7/10\"\n\nCato eats the crepes enjoying the different flavors of the fruit. \"Web I will be honest. I think this is much better then the Web Cubes *tm*. I really appreciate the mint. 8/10\"","created_at":"2020-08-18T05:27:02.272000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745151753447800873","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"KnightOfCydonia","id":"436232470242000916","is_bot":0,"username":"knightofcydonia21"},"author_id":"436232470242000916","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"Web... Ozgur, while crepes are a basic french dish and your crepes are delectable the addition of mint to them was a nice touch, although there wasn't any wow factor to get my attention, 7/10 very good job\"                             \"Skitter, wren, selene, madelines are famously french no doubt about that however your madelines seem to be all over the place in terms of flavor components and I don't quite see how the hot chocholate fits the french theme... regardless they are quite good but not grand 5/10\"                                                                                                         \"Wynne, Goose, and Baeshra, truly truly truly you have excelled tonight. Not only did you perfect macroons, but you also presented an incredible outting of steak and frites perfectly on theme, and lets talk about that ratatouille... goose you truly have a gift, the flavors, the textures its all amazing don't stop cooking please. You all have earned my respect in the kitchen 10/10\"","created_at":"2020-08-18T05:28:03.414000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-18T05:33:41.747000Z","id":"745152009895674017","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ghost Magician","id":"494537794027388928","is_bot":0,"username":"ghostmagician"},"author_id":"494537794027388928","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"“Team 1 truly amazing, the steak melts in my mouth. The macarons are perfection, I feel so refreshed after eating them. You’ve given me a complete, and delicious french meal \n9/10\n\nTeam 2 this chocolate was delicious, the madeleines are a bit too spongey for me, but still tastes good. So the texture was just a bit off for me.\n6/10\n\nTeam 3 I love these crepes, truly a french delicacy. Nails the theme spot on, and also tastes delicious.\n8/10","created_at":"2020-08-18T05:29:51.501000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745152463245672559","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
